{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB全新處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》昨晚（10日）首播即引爆熱話！劇中車婉婉飾演的「唐師奶」唐曹嘉冰，與飾演女兒的吳若希火花四濺，其「嫲」煩又嘈閉的師奶形象，竟意外勾起網民集體回憶，更發現她與「根叔」劉丹之間竟藏著一個驚人玄機！</p><p>首播即爆火花！車婉婉吳若希母女大鬥法</p><p>劇集一開場，吳若希飾演的控制狂公關女王唐萬里，便要處理女兒唐芯的「校園非禮暴力事件」及母親唐師奶（車婉婉飾）的「飛機讓座事件」，可謂頭頭碰著黑。車婉婉飾演的唐師奶由加拿大回港後，借故搬入女兒家中，兩母女矛盾一觸即發。不論是車婉婉在「讓座事件」中，以貓捉老鼠般的戲謔表情應對女兒的質問，還是在回憶片段中，心痛又強硬地逼年輕的吳若希墮胎，兩人的對手戲充滿喜劇節奏與正劇張力，火花十足，讓觀眾看得相當肉緊。</p><p>接棒劉丹有玄機？網民驚揭《皆大歡喜》萬貴妃回憶殺</p><p>車婉婉今次接替《愛‧回家》系列的靈魂人物「根叔」劉丹，擔正全新處境劇，本已備受關注。沒想到她入型入格的「野蠻嘈嘈閉師奶」演繹，竟令大批網民立即聯想起她多年前在經典劇集《皆大歡喜》中飾演的野蠻專橫搞笑萬貴妃，角色形象深入民心。更令網民嘖嘖稱奇的是，當年《皆大歡喜》中飾演皇帝的正是劉丹！如今車婉婉接棒劉丹成為處境劇新當家，這個橫跨多年的奇妙巧合，被網民形容為極具「玄機」，彷彿是冥冥中的一種傳承。</p><p>網民洗版激讚：「回憶返哂嚟！」</p><p>對於車婉婉的演出，網民反應極為熱烈，紛紛湧入討論區洗版。不少人大讚她的演繹「啜核」，完全演活了麻煩師奶的神髓，更直言勾起了當年的追劇回憶：「見到車婉婉就諗起萬貴妃，回憶返哂嚟！」、「婉婉接丹爺棒，原來個玄機喺度，TVB識玩！」、「呢個組合好有新鮮感，夠貼地、正路」、「車婉婉同吳若希啲對手戲好有火花，好期待之後點鬥！」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_11388163706a7aa06bf4061.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_21012432586a7aa06e75cf3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_13033968586a7aa0718dc1b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_6438970666a7aa074d0767.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_16579754376a7aa0778a96a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_2791052856a7aa07ae4831.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_15691154526a7aa07f5fbf2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_17329710316a7aa08248314.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_15853848976a7aa0856d7d3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_9578762606a7aa0881dc5d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_16632432106a7aa08b69df9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_20426741946a7aa08e68d78.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_2839909526a7aa091e8891.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14a_12451844106a7aa094dc1bb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_9513652826a7aa097c600f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_16340110276a7aa09b2ea59.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_19515645426a7aa09fa0523.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_10030244116a7aa0a4cb36f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_8192196806a7aa0a7bda55.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_4354126306a7aa0ab21dbe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_3021086626a7aa0ae4b420.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_15204064586a7aa0b17e6a7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_19521429626a7aa0b4ba200.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_545952646a7aa0b9038cb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_7936399036a7aa0bd3402c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_5763200696a7aa0c053acf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_21354211526a7aa0c309827.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_13613421606a7aa0c5e51c7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_10802177646a7aa0c903a93.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_13493465416a7aa0cc0c17a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_21325435856a7aa0cf23db1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_12845607226a7aa0d25012e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_18274394246a7aa0d616983.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_18234983216a7aa0d9443a3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_2717431566a7aa0dc7b64a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_8483500346a7aa0df6565f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_9821376496a7aa0e2c0189.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/37_21419094466a7aa0e595372.jpeg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 愛‧回家之三代同糖 皆大歡喜 車婉婉</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 11 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T05:59:15.354439+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1142,"images":38,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}